  "description": "Proposed removal of glazing from eight windows. Windows x3 on the ground floor south elevation, windows x3 on the first-floor east elevation and two windows on the second-floor east elevation.Windows x5 on the east elevation replaced with aluminium acoustic louvres,the three windows on the south elevation (Front) will be tackled differently, as this is the front facade of the building, we will only be removing the glazing from these windows and leaving the window frame intact. The acoustic louvres will be installed on the internal side of the window. These louvres will be powder coated black to telephone exchange",
